module gunbc.recurring_failure_mode.effectful_callable_passed_where_a_pure_one_is_expected

import std.types { NonEmptyStr }
import std.decl_ref { DeclarationRef, WholeDeclaration }
import gunbc.recurring_failure_mode { RecurringFailureMode }

data effectful_callable_passed_where_a_pure_one_is_expected: RecurringFailureMode = RecurringFailureMode {
  identity: "effectful_callable_passed_where_a_pure_one_is_expected" as NonEmptyStr,

  receipts: [
    "INVALID STATE: a function value whose body performs an effect (a thunk `fn() { read_the_store() }`, a fold step that probes the host) is passed to a parameter of function type. A `.dag` function type `fn(A) -> B` carries no effect row, so the receiving function is judged, summarized and emitted as PURE while one of its calls performs whatever the argument does. The seed interpreter evaluates the closure wherever it is applied, so the program runs and its witnesses pass; the Rust emission realizes the receiver as a synchronous fn and the argument as a closure whose body awaits, which rustc refuses with E0728 (`await` is only allowed inside `async` functions and blocks). Accepted source, green by interpretation, unrealizable natively.",
    "HARM: two, and the second outlives a repaired emitter. (1) The native artifact does not compile, and nothing before cargo says so: the compile reports zero blocking diagnostics. (2) The receiver's purity claim is false. Its effect summary is a lower bound that omits the argument's effects, so a reader, a witness and any analysis that keys on the summary are told that a function which reads a store reads nothing. A comment on such a function saying `pure, so every arm is witnessed without a store` is true of the witness's arguments and false of the production call.",
    "THE SIGNAL THAT ALREADY NAMES IT: the advisory `effect summary incomplete: <caller> calls through a function value, whose callee is chosen at runtime, so its effects are unknown rather than empty` (`v1.std.core` `EffectSummaryIncompleteAtFunctionValue`). It fires at the RECEIVER, on every call through a function value, pure or not, which is why it is an advisory and why `gunbc.compile_clean_diagnostic_policy` rosters it as a wall after grounding: promoting it would refuse every higher-order call. The defect is the subset where the ARGUMENT is effectful, and the fact that selects that subset sits at the call site that builds the function value, not at the receiver.",
    "RECEIPTS, the native approval broker program (2026-10-04), the closure of `gunbc.auth.approval_broker_serve`. (a) `gunbc.auth.approval_store_receipt` `store_receipt_answer` passed three thunks -- the escalation slot, its generation-1 filing, the receipt keyring -- into `store_receipt_answer_over`, which claimed purity and called them only after authenticating the asker. Three E0728. (b) `gunbc.host_cli_dependency` `first_absent_host_cli_dependency` passed a step that calls `observe_host_cli_dependency` (a `shell.PosixCommandV.Check`) to `v2.std.algebra` `fold_list`. One E0728.",
    "CLASSIFICATION RULE, applied per site and worth keeping because the tempting repair is wrong in both directions. Ask what the deferral BUYS. In (a) it buys an ORDER: authenticate, and only then read, so an unauthenticated asker learns nothing about which escalations exist and cannot make the broker read a secret. In (b) it buys a SHORT CIRCUIT: no tool after the first absent one is probed. Both are load-bearing, so hoisting the effects ahead of the call (read everything, pass values) would have changed behaviour -- in (a) it would have put three reads, one of a secret, in front of the authentication. Neither NEEDS a function value: an order between effects and a short circuit are control flow, and the function that performs the effects can hold that control flow itself. So the conditionality was kept and the function value was removed.",
    "THE REPAIR SHAPE: split the pure receiver at the point where it called the function value. Everything before that point is one pure function returning a typed standing (`authenticate_store_receipt_asker` -> `StoreReceiptAsker`); everything after is a pure function over the values (`issue_store_receipt_over`, `store_receipt_issuance_answer`); the effectful route matches on the standing and performs the effects, by name, in the arm that needs them. For a traversal, the effectful function recurses directly in tail position (`first_absent_host_cli_dependency`), which `v1.compiler.emit_rust` realizes as a loop (`gunbc.recurring_failure_mode.derived_effectful_recursion_bypasses_admission`). This is the root repair and not a route around the emitter: after it, every function's effect summary is exact and the pure halves really are pure.",
    "REVIEW TELL: a parameter of type `fn() -> T` on a function described as pure or as `over supplied readings`. A nullary function type has exactly one reason to exist -- deferring something -- and a pure computation gains nothing from deferral, so the parameter is either unnecessary or a carrier for an effect its type cannot state. The second tell is a witness that passes constant thunks (`fn() { fixture }`) where production passes readers: the witness is exercising a different function than production runs.",
    "RUNG FOUND AT: 1, and only by the target toolchain -- cargo refuses the emitted crate; no gunbc path refuses the source. CEILING: structurally guaranteed. NEXT-RUNG TRIGGER, NAMING THE CAPABILITY: the compiler refuses, at the call site that constructs it, a function value whose body's effect summary is non-empty when the parameter it is bound to cannot carry effects -- on the acceptance path, for interpretation and every emission target alike. The body's summary is already derived, so that refusal needs no new function type. The stronger capability, an effect row on the function type that would make such a call ADMISSIBLE and exactly summarized, is the grounding `gunbc.compile_clean_diagnostic_policy` names for the advisory; it is a language-layer decision reserved to the operator and is not this row's trigger.",
    "POPULATION, NOT MEASURED: the four sites above are the ones the broker's closure reaches. Every other effectful step handed to a fold-family function or a function-typed parameter in the corpus is the same class and is invisible until its closure is emitted natively.",
  ],

  evidence: [
    DeclarationRef { module_path: "gunbc.auth.approval_store_receipt", decl_name: "authenticate_store_receipt_asker", field: WholeDeclaration },
    DeclarationRef { module_path: "gunbc.auth.approval_store_receipt", decl_name: "store_receipt_answer", field: WholeDeclaration },
    DeclarationRef { module_path: "gunbc.host_cli_dependency", decl_name: "first_absent_host_cli_dependency", field: WholeDeclaration },
  ],
}
